      "text": "LOOK: Philippine National Police (PNP) personnel from the Muntinlupa City Police Station conduct bicycle patrols along the main road in Barangay Tunasan, Muntinlupa City on Wednesday, March 11.\n\nThe initiative is part of the PNP’s efforts to conserve fuel amid concerns over a looming oil crisis linked to ongoing tensions in the Middle East. Authorities say the move also helps maintain police visibility and allows officers to better navigate traffic and narrow streets in communities.\n\n📷: Mark Balmores | MB",
